  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When the WebAC module retrieves the list of classes for a binary, it always returns the classes of the fcr:metadata description (namely, fedora:NonRdfSourceDescription and fedora:Resource), and not the classes that are actually of the binary itself.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This prevents acl:accessToClass-based WebAC authorizations from working properly.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
