  "description": "<p>When the WebAC module retrieves the list of classes for a binary, it always returns the classes of the fcr:metadata description (namely, fedora:NonRdfSourceDescription and fedora:Resource), and not the classes that are actually of the binary itself.</p>\n\n<p>This prevents acl:accessToClass-based WebAC authorizations from working properly.</p>",
